K\n15jnp1IplhIg2QH7evy0OkUa1VYOwjUUYXD0fUN10wTjUBD3Mw2E9HtbbGJq\n+WSK6Hx4u05xN+h/JA9do67M38NLLtWnQ4DRou5n9LX/h5JOzRCteXHGUXba\ndLmnmRU55q1oOAFMI2zPHDrW70hFt9TO6Kg9W3/jdNajS8XxkktqU254GwgN\nm+FFpKEkSzOlrDVaPh6lLeNYfpj03rRS2mZL58ZuG0y5S+CDTmrbNYlcNxxn\nhkbu+FW2Hg5kfWFPrCvW45b1FljTg9OOZ/8kDO/5A7GvT3vD/4s7qkUwOD4g\nm4L9rZDH4jfNOi6cLmqOdOdyiLweG3V9PcoWqUHb/O1D/5XW3BlaZ6Tk5ezo\nETEynnpwC2LJs+o99rEvYfHIDb+/J7xTaNPWpluV3QcIvM/NkJu7oXNRA+Sh\nArKoqcQM6DA7wkrtbEbod6k1E+QZ\n",
    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "## Modify & Make \r\n\r\nUse `try...catch` to give the app a safety net. \r\n\r\n#### Do This:\r\n\r\n1. Wrap the `fetch()` and `await` lines inside a try block.\r\n2. Add a `catch` block that shows an error message using showActivity().\r\n\r\n   **Example:**\r\n    ```\r\n    showActivity(\"Oops! Try again!\")\r\n    ```",
    "submittable": "false",
    "hide_share_and_remix": "false",
